347 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 196 0 R
/E (Who conducts a search can make an important difference in determining which constitutional standards apply. Public-school teachers, administrators, and other school officials are government actors; they do not follow the same search process as separate law enforcement. A public-school official generally does not need a warrant or probable cause to search a student. Instead, the search ordinarily must be justified by reasonable suspicion.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
