<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 206 0 R
/E (The Court did not decide whether a student has a legitimate expectation of privacy in lockers, desks, or other school property provided for storage. The Court also did not express an opinion on the standards governing searches of those areas by school officials or public authorities acting at the request of school officials.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [12]
>>
