546 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 207 0 R
/E (And one time before you go return to that hallway. The bell has already rung. Students are still moving toward lunch, lockers are still closing, conversations continue to overlap, and somewhere down the hall, someone is probably still trying to finish an assignment before the next period. But now, imagine that administrator is standing in front of you again. Your backpack is still hanging from your shoulder. And your still starving, wanting to go to lunch. And after all of that. The same question is still waiting:)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
